 0030   0006    '----- GAME5.BAS: player rendering module (walk-to movement pha
                se 1).
 0030   0006    '----- Fifth code module -> its own 64K code segment. Pure libr
                ary like GAME4
 0030   0006    '----- (no COMMON SHARED): callers pass sprite/mask/save-under 
                arrays as params.
 0030   0006    '-----
 0030   0006    '----- PStand: erase the standing player (save-under PSET) then
                 draw facing d$
 0030   0006    '-----   ("2"=dn "8"=up "4"=lt "6"=rt "1"=dl "7"=ul "9"=ur "3"=
                dr, ""=erase only).
 0030   0006    '-----   nopl close-up rooms erase but never draw, matching the
                 old face: code.
 0030   0006    '----- PStep: one walk half-step at (x,y): GET save-under, mask
                ed frame draw
 0030   0006    '-----   (fb 0=frame A, 1=frame B), footstep sound (the SOUNDs 
                are the pacing),
 0030   0006    '-----   then restore the save-under so the next half-step star
                ts clean.
 0030   0006    '-----   ofs = start element in the frame arrays (0 for plain w
                a/wb scratch,
 0030   0006    '-----   d*151 to pick a direction slot out of the startup-cach
                ed sets).
 0030   0006    '-----   (named ofs because OFF is a QB reserved word)
 0030   0006    '----- LoadWalks: read joew1-8 .pct/.msk once into the 8-slot c
                ache arrays
 0030   0006    '-----   (slot d*151: 0=down/joew1, 1=up/joew2, 2=right/joew3, 
                3=left/joew4,
 0030   0006    '-----   4=dn-left/joew5, 5=dn-right/joew6, 6=up-left/joew7, 7=
                up-right/joew8)
 0030   0006    '-----   so walking never re-reads sprite files from disk mid-g
                ame.
 0030   0006    '----- walkTo: walk the player from (px,py) to (tx,ty) DIAGONAL
                -FIRST --
 0030   0006    '-----   full (3,2) steps with the matching diagonal sprite set
                 while BOTH
 0030   0006    '-----   axes still have a step left, then the remainder on the
                 classic
 0030   0006    '-----   straight rails (horizontal 3px, then vertical 2px), fr
                ames
 0030   0006    '-----   alternating, per-direction sound pacing (right/left 1,
                 down 1.2,
 0030   0006    '-----   up 1.4, dn-diagonals 1.1, up-diagonals 1.2). Updates p
                x,py by ref.
 0030   0006    
 0030   0006    '----- wfb: the walk stride phase (0=frame A, 1=frame B). Modul
                e-level so it
 0030   0006    '----- PERSISTS across walkTo calls -- short diagonal legs (1-3
                 steps) would
 0030   0006    '----- otherwise restart on frame A every walk and frame B woul
                d never show.
 0030   0006    DIM SHARED wfb%
 0030   0006    
 0030   0006    SUB PStand (d$, px!, py!, nopl!, fbg%(), fd%(), mfd%(), fu%(), 
